        },
        "description": "A young girl who previously lived with abusive foster parents. She was the victim of abuse both by the adults and their two other children, living in a &quot;Cinderella-like&quot; situation until Michiko came to her rescue. She is hesitant to trust the woman, but they share the same tattoo on their stomachs.",
